00_AQBzQyzqVL7g1s_xkX4kKT_EVWO7znZWplhbNm1Yx7Bngw&oe=6A6A06D7"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "1158447621850397", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035353_1158447625183730_6458765565871963951_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=s2-bX01bXdcQ7kNvwHPvs_I&_nc_oc=Adot697-ERLAhxZGUyZbSvTR2kbdZq29aE7Sneqg-esaF15UpVDrlZfrigFf-Fns-k8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQA5ne8tPgqUv9oRaWklRp0b5W69ZQ3TWXPezOpof28tEA&oe=6A6A04E1"}, {"file_name": "3.png", "id": "430710953030699", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982609_430710956364032_6150975977529824521_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=BUuQgKvZ2GUQ7kNvwGH7i3e&_nc_oc=AdpfaNorUZUZQsL5hAzXgoWa4rERrxyTMR25chUr7A7K6PjJTdmMVE1HsDTXZM-Yo08&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQA0dqhVW631FbOKV5VH5Oi_6lwsk8Sxxzu-sa-0Kstq1w&oe=6A69F317"}, {"file_name": "2.png", "id": "837774275033767", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982616_837774278367100_4897090437410338032_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=2hGfa0admXoQ7kNvwGKIqdu&_nc_oc=Adrry_20VszbNwWPkw5fhzvze6mBZFOX6ri4tbY3HO98BgYM9gK_0Hls0vvlbS-3t1A&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQC3oDQuq9dtQZQoFgi6d5JvGYNTHimkbw-9fB0AkogDQA&oe=6A69F9A2"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "land-2560x1440.png", "id": "801538871433377", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984470_801538874766710_7104644288614866285_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5j_v-6Ma_IAQ7kNvwGemMk4&_nc_oc=AdoXVHafJFaFBWZrCsqf0XP11xmUyNV9-YqnLBm-riRx4Fa_Cn5-qlp1OSsSvPVqtb8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAIIjh0JH81_J2DU9EHiddZQ18N0_L6gcRkOf0hYRND9g&oe=6A69E5EE"}, "display_name": "shadow", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Travel through a series of increasingly complex levels, each designed to test your ability to visualize and manipulate 3D structures in a VR environment. With intuitive controls, you can directly interact with the cube and tubes, manipulating them with precision to create clear paths that abide by the rules.\nShadow is not just a game; it's a brain-teasing journey that unfolds within a minimalist, visually stunning universe that evolves as you progress. Each successful connection not only brings satisfaction but also unlocks new levels and complexities. This game ensures that every solution is a burst of dopamine as you see your spatial reasoning skills visibly improve.\nImmersive VR Experience: Feel the thrill of manipulating complex 3D puzzles in a fully immersive VR environment.\nChallenging Gameplay: Master the art of connecting points without intersection, crafting a continuous path through various angles and perspectives.\nProgressive Difficulty: As you advance, the puzzles increase in complexity, offering endless hours of engaging gameplay.\nEducational and Fun: Perfect for puzzle enthusiasts and those looking to sharpen their spatial thinking and geometry skills.\n\nPrepare to stretch your mind and enjoy a unique blend of puzzle-solving and construction in Shadow, where every level is a new opportunity to prove your ingenious problem-solving prowess in the virtual world!", "short_description": "Embark on a mesmerizing puzzle adventure in the virtual world of Shadow, where logic and creativity intertwine. Dive into an immersive experience where you must connect the vertices of a seemingly simple cube using tubes based on orthographic projections. But there's a twist\u2014ensure the tubes do not intersect and remain continuous, challenging your spatial awareness and problem-solving skills."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://digitalsolutions.mn/policy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "DigitalSolutionsVR", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://digitalsolutions.mn/", "catego